<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Make It Through the Night</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">BEAUTY SCHOOL DROPOUT</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Make It Through the Night</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2p4NVqOXdUREQ1BOWeApz0</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.200" end="00:09.890">I don't think that I will make it through the night with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.890" end="00:13.750">Make it through the night with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.750" end="00:20.180">I don't think that I will make it through the night with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.180" end="00:23.690">Make it through the night with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.690" end="00:25.850">I met you in a ball, now you're colder than a winter</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.850" end="00:28.540">I gave you my all, thought that I was really winning</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.540" end="00:30.840">Love went like the seasons, now we're really splitting</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.840" end="00:34.340">Was it love or lust, I don't think you know the difference, oh yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.340" end="00:39.740">I could see it coming from a mile away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.740" end="00:42.580">But the more I put it off</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.580" end="00:44.640">The more I want to say that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.640" end="00:51.010">I don't think that I will make it through the night with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.010" end="00:54.770">Make it through the night with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.770" end="01:01.420">I don't think that I will make it through the night with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.420" end="01:04.620">Make it through the night with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.620" end="01:07.240">Wanna be alone, I don't wanna be lonely</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.240" end="01:09.660">You don't keep in touch, you just follow all my homies</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.660" end="01:12.380">Went back to all your foes, yeah that's what we call a phony</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.380" end="01:15.790">So don't apologise now, you only knew the old me, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.790" end="01:20.980">I could see it coming from a mile away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.980" end="01:23.520">But the more I put it off</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.520" end="01:25.820">The more I want to say that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.820" end="01:32.380">I don't think that I will make it through the night with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.380" end="01:36.280">Make it through the night with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.280" end="01:42.600">I don't think that I will make it through the night with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.600" end="01:46.300">Make it through the night with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.300" end="01:53.060">Said I don't think that I will make it through the night with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.060" end="01:57.130">Make it through the night with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.130" end="02:03.260">I don't think that I will make it through the night with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.260" end="02:07.720">Make it through the night with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.720" end="02:12.150">Damn</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.150" end="02:16.150" /></div></body></tt>